<http://data.silknow.org/object/c7198f61-b394-3b36-8c71-0d56e99d7e69>
        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Dress fabric of painted silk, probably made in France, 1770-1775"@en , "Dress fabric of painted silk on the original wooden roller. Off-white silk ground painted with a fine pattern of honeysuckle, bluebells, acorns and oak leaves with heartsease, all tied with a cord with tasselled ends. At each side is a meandering sprigged stem. On the wooden roller at one end is an original 18th century label with '20 yds T/H 174 Jn'. The length suggests enough for two dress lengths."@en ;
        ecrm:P138i_has_representation  <http://data.silknow.org/image/90c67181-c4ce-391a-ab2f-b73ac5d2fa0f> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/02b99fb9-d630-3e2c-86a6-6da70563d1b2> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note               "Dress fabric of painted silk on the original wooden roller. Off-white silk ground painted with a fine pattern of honeysuckle, bluebells, acorns and oak leaves with heartsease, all tied with a cord with tasselled ends. At each side is a meandering sprigged stem. On the wooden roller at one end is an original 18th century label with '20 yds T/H 174 Jn'. The length suggests enough for two dress lengths."@en , "Dress fabric of painted silk, probably made in France, 1770-1775"@en ;
        ecrm:P43_has_dimension         <http://data.silknow.org/object/c7198f61-b394-3b36-8c71-0d56e99d7e69/dimension/4> , <http://data.silknow.org/object/c7198f61-b394-3b36-8c71-0d56e99d7e69/dimension/3> , <http://data.silknow.org/object/c7198f61-b394-3b36-8c71-0d56e99d7e69/dimension/2> , <http://data.silknow.org/object/c7198f61-b394-3b36-8c71-0d56e99d7e69/dimension/1> ;
